{
  "name": "Glowra 03 - Webhook Order ke Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · Webhook → Google Sheets\n\n**Alur:** order masuk via **POST** → dicek field wajibnya → nomor HP & nama dirapikan → **ditulis ke tab `Order_Masuk` di Google Sheet** → dibalas JSON.\n\n**Anti dobel:** kalau `no_pesanan` sudah ada di sheet, barisnya **diperbarui**, bukan ditambah.\n\n**Balasan:**\n- ✅ Tersimpan → **200**\n- ❌ Data tidak lengkap → **400** (tidak ditulis ke sheet)\n- ⚠️ Gagal menulis ke Google → **500** (order jangan dianggap masuk)\n\n**Sebelum dipakai:** isi kredensial Google + URL sheet di node *Simpan ke Google Sheets*. Panduan: `docs/05-webhook-ke-google-sheets.md`.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c3f0c003-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Catatan Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "glowra-order-sheets",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3f0c003-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Terima Order (Webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "8b7c3f10-2e4d-4a61-b0c9-3d5e7f902026"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validasi field wajib dari order yang masuk lewat webhook.\n// Hasil: { valid: true/false, errors: [...], order: {...data asli...} }\nconst WAJIB = ['channel', 'no_pesanan', 'sku', 'qty', 'nama_pembeli', 'no_hp'];\nconst CHANNEL_DIKENAL = ['shopee', 'tiktok', 'whatsapp'];\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const body = item.json.body || {};\n  const kosong = (v) => v === undefined || v === null || String(v).trim() === '';\n  const errors = [];\n\n  for (const field of WAJIB) {\n    if (kosong(body[field])) errors.push(`Field '${field}' wajib diisi`);\n  }\n  if (!kosong(body.channel) && !CHANNEL_DIKENAL.includes(String(body.channel).trim().toLowerCase())) {\n    errors.push(`Field 'channel' harus salah satu dari: ${CHANNEL_DIKENAL.join(', ')}`);\n  }\n  if (!kosong(body.qty)) {\n    const qty = Number(body.qty);\n    if (!Number.isInteger(qty) || qty <= 0) errors.push(\"Field 'qty' harus angka bulat lebih dari 0\");\n  }\n  if (!kosong(body.sku) && !/^GLW-[A-Z]{3}-\\d{3}$/.test(String(body.sku).trim().toUpperCase())) {\n    errors.push(\"Field 'sku' harus berformat GLW-XXX-000 (contoh: GLW-SRM-001)\");\n  }\n  if (!kosong(body.no_hp)) {\n    const digit = String(body.no_hp).replace(/\\D/g, '');\n    if (digit.length < 9 || digit.length > 15) errors.push(\"Field 'no_hp' harus berisi 9-15 digit angka\");\n  }\n\n  return { json: { valid: errors.length === 0, errors, order: body } };\n});\n"
      },
      "id": "c3f0c003-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Validasi Field Wajib",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d3000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3f0c003-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Data Lengkap?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Rapikan data order: nomor HP -> 628xxx, SKU huruf besar, nama Huruf Awal Kapital.\n// Aturan sama dengan scripts/clean_merge.py supaya hasilnya konsisten.\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const o = item.json.order;\n\n  let hp = String(o.no_hp).replace(/\\D/g, '');      // buang spasi, strip, +, ( )\n  if (hp.startsWith('0')) hp = '62' + hp.slice(1);  // 0812... -> 62812...\n  else if (hp.startsWith('8')) hp = '62' + hp;      // 812...  -> 62812...\n  const hpValid = hp.startsWith('628') && hp.length >= 11 && hp.length <= 14;\n\n  const nama = String(o.nama_pembeli)\n    .trim()\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')\n    .replace(/^(kak|ka|kk)\\s+/i, '')\n    .toLowerCase()\n    .replace(/(^|\\s)\\S/g, (c) => c.toUpperCase());\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      status: hpValid ? 'diterima' : 'perlu_cek',\n      pesan: hpValid\n        ? 'Order diterima dan siap diproses'\n        : 'Order diterima, tapi nomor HP bukan nomor Indonesia (628...). Mohon cek manual.',\n      order: {\n        channel: String(o.channel).trim().toLowerCase(),\n        no_pesanan: String(o.no_pesanan).trim(),\n        sku: String(o.sku).trim().toUpperCase(),\n        qty: Number(o.qty),\n        nama_pembeli: nama,\n        no_hp_asli: o.no_hp,\n        no_hp_normal: hp,\n      },\n      // Waktu WIB yang enak dibaca di sheet, contoh: 2026-11-13 14:05:09\n      diterima_pada_wib: $now.setZone('Asia/Jakarta').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss'),\n    },\n  };\n});\n"
      },
      "id": "c3f0c003-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Normalisasi No HP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
